 "schema": "gliner25-decide-gate/1",
 "what": "The classification graph of fastino/GLiNER2.5-Decide against the gliner2 2.0.0 fp32 oracle on the Mac: GATE-1 re-authored fp32 torch, GATE-2 poisoned label_idx, GATE-3 the fp16 bundle on the Mac GPU (Python runtime), and the Swift graph runner on the same bundles",
